{"id":"msg_m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_dorothy","label":"Dorothy · Nikke"},"label":"4. Your Grace,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_dorothy_03","next":"msg_m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_02","speakers":{"dorothy_s":"Dorothy"},"icons":{"dorothy_s":"si_c234_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_1","text":"Your Grace,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_2","text":"sorry to disturb you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_3","text":"but have you seen Rapi?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_4","text":"No, I haven't.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_5","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_6","text":"This is troubling.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_7","text":"If you don't know where she is, then I have no other leads.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_8","text":"What's wrong?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_9","text":"Nothing serious.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_10","text":"We were supposed to have tea time together,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_11","text":"but she hasn't shown up.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_12","text":"Haha, you two have gotten pretty close.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_13","text":"How many times do I have to say this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_14","text":"I have no intention on becoming friends with Rapi.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_15","text":"We communicate fairly well,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_16","text":"and she also has surprisingly good taste in tea.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_17","text":"Therefore, we meet up from time to time. That's all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_18","text":"Be honest. You enjoyed exploring that ship with everyone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_19","text":"It wasn't bad.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_20","text":"I see you changed your profile picture to you in a swimsuit?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_21","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_22","text":"I'd grown tired of my old profile picture.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_23","text":"That's all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_24","text":"Haha, if you say so.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_25","text":"Oh.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_26","text":"Rapi is here.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_27","text":"She said she was late because of work.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_28","text":"Mmm.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_29","text":"Your Grace,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_30","text":"do you have a moment?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_31","text":"Yeah, I'm taking a break right now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_32","text":"Then,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_33","text":"allow me to extend a formal invitation to you as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_34","text":"I can join too?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_35","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_36","text":"Having a few extra people over for tea can be a good thing,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_37","text":"and I happen to have some tea leaves left over.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dorothy_serendipity_01_38","text":"I appreciate the invite. I'll be right there.","jump":null}],"chat":true}